<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">• 해당대학에 신청기간 내 서류를 제출(우편 또는 타인제출 가능)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(우)730-701 : 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교 학생처</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">• </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">서류 제출 장소 : 학생처(본관101호)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 94.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -94.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">• 제출서류 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: -1.4pt\">①수급자증명서 ②장학금 신청서 및 서약서 ③성적증명서(신․편입생)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">※ 재학생 성적은 소속대학 담당자가 확인</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 5.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">수급자 자격이 확인된 학생은 제출서류 생략</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 21.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">신입생 성적은 학자금포털에 등재된 성적정보를 통해 심사할 예정. 단, 학자금포털에 등재된 성적기준이 미래드림 장학금 성적기준과 상이하거나 대학내부에 성적자료가 없는 학생에 한하여 대학에서 제출받은 성적자료를 활용하여 성적입력</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 32.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -32.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ◦</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">장학금 신청 후 아래 각각의 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">해당 서류를 신청기간 내에 학생처에 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">(모든 서류는 본인명의 발급)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: right\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"133\" bgcolor=\"#bcbcbc\" height=\"38\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: ’새굴림’\">서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt;